      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "复古模式近乎原样保留Amiga经典，经典模式则以新视觉、改良机制和流畅系统重新诠释。",
      "dimension": "画风",
      "excerpt": "Retro Mode . The original Amiga classic, preserved with near-perfect authenticity and quality-of-life enhancements. Classic Mode. Amiga classic reimagined for today. A completely new visual identity, refined mechanics, and smoother systems.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4208140/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "王国模式加入程序生成地图、特殊骰子、可解锁能力和多档难度，让每轮保持不可预测。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Kingdom Mode. An entirely new challenge. Procedurally generated maps, special dice mechanics, unlockable abilities, and multiple difficulty levels to keep every run unpredictable.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4208140/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
